{"id": "1594731", "name": "חיבור, חיסור וכפל בסקלאר של מטריצה", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "functions": [{"name": "texp", "params": ["x"], "body": "if numberp(x) and x<0 then concat(\"\\\\left(\",tex1(x),\"\\\\right)\") else tex1(x)"}, {"name": "texmul", "params": ["e"], "body": "simplode(map(texp, args(e)), \" \\\\cdot \")"}, {"name": "texsumf", "params": ["e"], "body": "block([L:first(args(e))], concat(tex1(first(L)), apply(sconcat, map(lambda([t], concat(\"+\",texp(t))), rest(L)))))"}, {"name": "texsubf", "params": ["e"], "body": "concat(tex1(first(args(e))), \"-\", texp(second(args(e))))"}, {"name": "texsq", "params": ["e"], "body": "concat(texp(first(args(e))), \"^2\")"}, {"name": "prodshow", "params": ["P", "Q"], "body": "genmatrix(lambda([i,j], sumf(makelist(mul(P[i,l],Q[l,j]),l,1,length(Q)))), length(P), length(first(Q)))"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>נתונות שתי מטריצות:</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[A={{CT:0}}, \\, B={{CT:1}}\\]</p></div><p>חשבו את המטריצות הבאות:</p><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">א׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(A+A=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint input-hint-grid\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: כל איבר בתיבה משלו: מספר, שבר (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">1/2</code>) או ביטוי (למשל <code dir=\"ltr\">sqrt(2)</code>).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ב׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(A-B=\\) [[input:ans2]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans2]]</div></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:8px\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:26px;height:26px;line-height:26px;text-align:center;border-radius:50%;background:#4b1f6f;color:#fff;margin-left:8px\">ג׳</span></div><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\({{CT:2}}\\cdot A=\\) [[input:ans3]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans3]]</div></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> כל הפעולות מתבצעות איבר-איבר: חיבור וחיסור של איברים במקומות המתאימים, וכפל של כל איבר בסקלר.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — חיבור (סעיף א׳)</b><br>מחברים מטריצות מאותו גודל איבר-איבר:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ A+A={{CT:3}}={{CT:4}} \\]</p>זו גם המטריצה <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(2A\\)</span>.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — חיסור (סעיף ב׳)</b><br>מחסירים איבר-איבר:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ A-B={{CT:5}}={{CT:6}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 3 — כפל בסקלר (סעיף ג׳)</b><br>כופלים כל איבר של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(A\\)</span> ב-<span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:2}}\\)</span>:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:2}}\\cdot A={{CT:7}}={{CT:8}} \\]</p></div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]<br>[[feedback:prt2]]<br>[[feedback:prt3]]<br>", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "A", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([a,b,c],[d,e,f])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "A", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([a,b,c],[d,e,f])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "matrix", "boxsize": 15, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "A", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "matrix([a,b,c],[d,e,f])", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "an